{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--linkedin-skills","name":"linkedin-skills","description":"Use when someone wants to grow an organic LinkedIn presence — a content strategy for a career change or consulting or thought leadership, a rewritten profile or headline, post drafts and hooks, a posting cadence or newsletter plan, connection notes and outreach, a commenting strategy, repurposing an article or talk into posts, or a read on why their reach dropped. Triggers on \"grow my LinkedIn\", \"fix my headline\", \"write a LinkedIn post\", \"what should I post about\", \"LinkedIn strategy\", \"connection request\", \"my reach dropped\". Forks context to route to one of five sub-skills, and refuses automation, scraping, pods, and bulk DMs before any drafting starts.","category":"Product & business","tags":["linkedin","skills","when","someone","wants","grow","organic","presence","content","strategy","career","change","consulting","thought","leadership","rewritten","profile","headline"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"marketing/linkedin/skills/linkedin-skills","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/marketing/linkedin/skills/linkedin-skills","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":7,"bytes":50239,"sha256":"9b162dfd610689c9e046a1734ca0f905a86cd777f1856f8b2cb753480097c86b","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"marketing/linkedin/skills/linkedin-skills/SKILL.md","bytes":5702,"sha256":"9b162dfd610689c9e046a1734ca0f905a86cd777f1856f8b2cb753480097c86b","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/marketing/linkedin/skills/linkedin-skills/SKILL.md"},{"path":"asset